# Rendered style references for the icon generator. Derived from the authored
# SVG masters by scripts/icons/export-style-refs.mjs and uploaded to the
# private bev-style-refs bucket; the bucket is what the worker reads, so the
# local copy is an intermediate. Not committed, because its hashes depend on
# whatever icon batch is in flight -- committing them would ship a drift guard
# that fails on a clean checkout.
design/beverage-icons/style-refs/
